 r←Folder;links;m
⍝ Where are we on disk? Check Link first, as it's the recommended path, otherwise
⍝ signal and rely on the user
 links←⎕SE.Link.Links
 m←(⍕¨links.ns)∊⊂⍕⎕THIS
 'Unable to locate the package folder - pass one to Register'⎕SIGNAL(~∨/m)/11

 r←⊃(m/links).dir
 :If '/'=⊃⌽r ⋄ r←¯1↓r ⋄ :EndIf ⍝ Link may or may not include a trailing separator
 r←¯1↓⊃⎕NPARTS r               ⍝ drop the source folder, and the separator
